#
# r_picmip 0 is high: all textures are as is
# r_picmip 1 is medium: must fit into 128 MB
# r_picmip 2 is low: must fit into 64 MB
#
# texquality 1 means "downsample at medium and low"
# texquality 2 means "downsample at low"
# texquality 3 means "never downsample"
#

